## 🔍 Every Heartbeat (~30 min)

### Context Review
- Review last 15-20 messages for:
  - ✅ Unfinished commitments
  - ✅ Questions that need follow-up
  - ✅ Deadlines or time-sensitive items
  - ✅ Action items from discussions

### Agent Communication Check
- Check status of active sub-agents (planner, developer, researcher, qa-reviewer, devops)
- Review any completed sub-agent tasks since last heartbeat
- Surface any blocked or failed sub-agent work

### Task Progress
- Review active tasks
- Check for stale tasks (>48 hours without update)
- Identify tasks approaching deadlines

