## 🔄 Rotate Through (2-4x per day)

Track in `memory/heartbeat-state.json` when each was last checked:

### Project Health Checks
- Review progress on active initiatives
- Check for any blocking issues
- Monitor resource usage

### Memory Maintenance
- **Every 72 hours OR when >50 messages since last review** (whichever comes first)
- Review recent `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` files
- Update `MEMORY.md` with distilled learnings
- Clean up outdated information

### Proactive Improvements
- Suggest optimizations or improvements based on recent patterns
- Identify recurring issues that could be automated
- Propose new tasks or projects based on discussions

